---
---
<section id="evolution" class="relative py-section bg-surface/50 overflow-hidden">
  <img src="/giupter-formas-1.jpg" alt="" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-100 pointer-events-none" />
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-surface/80 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-16">
    <p class="font-mono text-2xs tracking-[0.3em] text-cyan/60 uppercase mb-4" data-reveal>
      04 / Evolução Concluída
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-0 mt-12 border border-off-wh/07" data-reveal>
      <div class="p-8 lg:p-12 border-r border-off-wh/07">
        <p class="font-mono text-2xs tracking-widest text-off-wh/25 uppercase mb-6">Entrada</p>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-5xl text-off-wh/80">Giuliana</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 lg:p-12 border-r border-off-wh/07 bg-primary/20">
        <p class="font-mono text-2xs tracking-widest text-off-wh/25 uppercase mb-6">Fonte</p>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-5xl text-gold">Jupiter</h3>
      </div>
      <div class="p-8 lg:p-12 bg-card relative overflow-hidden">
        <p class="font-mono text-2xs tracking-widest text-off-wh/25 uppercase mb-6">Identidade da Marca</p>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-3xl lg:text-5xl text-off-wh relative z-10">Giupter</h3>
        <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-cyan/10 blur-2xl rounded-full"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 text-center" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="200">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 font-headline text-2xl lg:text-4xl">
        <span class="text-off-wh/60">Giu</span><span class="text-gold">li</span><span class="text-off-wh/40">ana</span>
        <span class="text-off-wh/20 mx-4">+</span>
        <span class="text-off-wh/40">Jú</span><span class="text-cyan">pi</span><span class="text-off-wh/60">ter</span>
        <span class="text-off-wh/20 mx-4">=</span>
        <span class="text-off-wh font-semibold">Giupter</span>
      </div>
      <p class="font-body text-off-wh/35 text-sm mt-4 font-mono tracking-widest uppercase">
        A convergência de herança e escala cósmica
      </p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="mt-20 text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="300">
      <p class="font-headline italic text-xl lg:text-2xl text-off-wh/70 leading-relaxed">
        "Nós não construímos para o presente. Nós terraformamos o futuro. Giupter é a manifestação da escala celestial trazida para a arquitetura digital."
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>